title: Awesome AI Risk Management in Finance
message: >-
  If you use this list, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  A curated list of resources for managing the risk of AI in financial
  services: supervisory guidance, standards, model risk management practice,
  tooling, research, and reading. The focus is AI risk in financial services,
  with a finance lens throughout.
